{
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "tfm2_custom_gojo": {
        "name": "Gojo",
        "skill": "Six Eyes: 100 CE, efficient techniques and separate strain. CE regenerates 3/s (6/s after four seconds without champion damage). Infinity: 200 + 50% AP, 75% skill / 30% basic damage reduction, 1 CE/s upkeep; broken shield reforms after 15s for 5 CE. During CE shortage or burnout the remaining shield can absorb damage, but reductions and rebuilding pause; allied shields stay untouched. Blue: 6 CE / 5 strain, 10s cooldown, 0.4s preparation. Existing Blue damage/pull; grants two enhanced punches for 4s (+15 + 20% AP each). Maximum Output: 12 CE / 15 strain, 0.9s preparation, 135% damage and 36000 radius.",
        "skill2": "Red: 10 CE / 7 strain, 9s cooldown, 0.4s preparation; existing direct hit/explosion. Maximum Output: 20 CE / 18 strain, 1s preparation, 135% damage and 26000 radius. Native contextual techniques: RCT heals 80 + 50% AP over 1s (20 CE, 8 strain, 14s cooldown); Spatial Step travels up to 32000 (8 CE, 8 strain, 12s cooldown). After Blue/Red hits a champion, two melee hits on that champion within 4s earn Black Flash (+30 + 35% AP; 6s trigger cooldown). Each qualifying punch costs 1 CE / 1 strain. Black Flash removes 10 strain and grants 20% more Gojo-kit damage for 8s; subsequent flashes refresh without stacking.",
        "ult": "Unlimited Void: 40 CE / 45 strain, 60s cooldown, 76000 radius. One nearest allied champion is chosen once as the protected guest; every other ally caught is stunned and sealed alongside enemies. Gojo is free after the casting lock. Existing slow/fast expansion retained. Domain closure causes 3s burnout. At 100 strain: 4s burnout, Domain collapses; Infinity reductions and Limitless techniques pause, melee/RCT remain. Purple requires ultimate learned and both Blue/Red ready: 34 CE / 30 strain, 20s cooldown, 200 + 160% AP; shares Blue/Red cooldowns. No mastery variants."
      }
    }
  }
}
